# Tax Assumptions

Since CVEN would likely operate globally:

### Years 1-2

Losses carried forward.

```text
Tax Rate = 0%
```

---

### Years 3-5

Tax incentives

R&D credits

Innovation grants

Effective tax rate:

```text
15%
```

---

### Years 6-10

Mature multinational company:

Effective tax rate:

```text
22%
```

---

