## Strategic Insight

After incorporating taxes and working capital, CVEN remains highly attractive because the business is asset-light, subscription-driven, and AI-powered. Most of the value comes from recurring software revenue, government analytics contracts, marketplace fees, and the AI Growth Intelligence platform, resulting in strong free cash flow generation once scale is reached.
